      "canonicalConceptId": "concept:89c11be0aead3fd99d97dcd80c928c7a10531c7d3e2f1ee21a74596ae9337137",
      "text": "Salesforce Pub/Sub client selection depends on native gRPC streaming capability, an Avro library, and the support status of the chosen implementation. Salesforce distinguishes officially supported Java samples from other language and community examples. Browser compatibility needs separate evaluation: Subscribe is bidirectional, while the official gRPC-Web client supports unary and server-streaming calls through a proxy. Improbable documents a separate WebSocket transport with a configured proxy; that exception does not establish direct Salesforce endpoint compatibility.",
